1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,641
Black Cat, Tan Cat
黑猫，棕猫

2
00:00:01,738 --> 00:00:02,880
Look at Black Cat
看看黑猫

3
00:00:02,978 --> 00:00:03,936
He's on his mat
他在他的垫子上

4
00:00:03,938 --> 00:00:05,480
He's happy, fat, and glad
他快乐，肥胖，快乐

5
00:00:05,698 --> 00:00:08,080
Tan Cat walks by his tail held high
棕猫高高地拖着尾巴走路

6
00:00:08,257 --> 00:00:10,160
And now Black Cat is mad
现在黑猫生气了

7
00:00:10,257 --> 00:00:12,281
He thinks Tan Cat  wants on his mat
他认为谭猫想上他的垫子

8
00:00:12,298 --> 00:00:13,920
Black Cat will never share
黑猫永远不会分享

9
00:00:13,977 --> 00:00:15,201
It is so sad
这太可悲了

10
00:00:15,378 --> 00:00:16,841
Tan Cat feels bad
谭猫感觉不好

11
00:00:16,858 --> 00:00:18,001
They could have been a pair
他们可能是一对

